<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Central Costanera started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Central Costanera started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had started coverage of Argentina's Central Costanera SA with a rating of near-term and long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The most difficult prospect for this company is confronting an almost inevitable free fall in revenues and earnings in the year 2000 when two large lucrative supply contracts expire,&quot; analysts David Hurd, Guillermo MacLean and Frank McGann wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Endesa de Chile is Central Costanera's operator and main shareholder.</p>
<p>-- Central Costanera was up 2 centavos at 2.98 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, 212 859-1879</p>
</text>
